OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome evening
OL,6,Fbrighter spells in the east but cloudy
OL,7,Fin the west with occasionally heavy
OL,8,Frain, this spreading east to all parts
OL,9,Fat times overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FOccasionally heavy rain soon
OL,12,Fclearing east. Then rather cloudy with
OL,13,Fscattered showers from the west, the
OL,14,Fbest of any dry and bright spells in
OL,15,Fthe east. Temperatures back near
OL,16,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
