OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud some bright spells on
OL,7,FSaturday and Sunday with a few light
OL,8,Fshowers. Likely turning wet and windy
OL,9,Fthrough Monday.
